  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Solar OM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project will create domestic value addition and employment, diversify Omani exports, and manufacture globally 40GW of solar modules annually. Additionally, USP will catalyze the creation of a new solar PV ecosystem in Oman and the wider GCC region, enhancing competitiveness and reducing reliance on oil and gas. Furthermore, the Project will expand the global resilience of the polysilicon value chain, by providing additional supply through a new location.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Solar Polysilicon (FZC) SPC (USP) is a special purpose vehicle implementing a greenfield 100,000 tonnes per annum (TPA) solar-grade polysilicon manufacturing facility located in Sohar, Oman (the Project or Company).</narrative>
  </description>
